  "details": "Hello VRChat Team,\n\nI would like to request a feature that adds an option in Settings to automatically delete cached files.\n\nCurrently, world and asset caches can only be cleared manually through the Debug section in Settings. As I visit many different worlds, the cache size continues to grow and takes up a significant amount of disk space on my PC. Because of this, I regularly have to clear the cache manually.\n\nIt would be very helpful to have a setting that automatically manages and deletes old cache files, or a toggle that enables automatic cache cleanup. This would help users save storage space and reduce the need for manual maintenance.\n\nThank you for your consideration.",
